# The build context is the monorepo root. apps/app (the dashboard build) and
# apps/server (the Go build) go into the image;
# the site and the edge worker contribute just their package.json, because
# pnpm needs every workspace manifest to install from the shared lockfile.
# Patterns are anchored to the root, so nested ones need **/.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
**/.vite
**/.source
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.wrangler
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
.DS_Store
**/data
docs
ops
scripts
**/*.test.ts
apps/app/src/server/gateway/fixtures
apps/site/*
!apps/site/package.json
apps/edge/*
!apps/edge/package.json
# The Go build: no fetched libraries or local binaries (the image fetches its
# own ONNX Runtime), no goldens or tests, no spike files.
apps/server/lib
apps/server/bin
apps/server/testdata
**/*_test.go
apps/server/Dockerfile.spike*
